lized` in QCC 12.2.0 (#310)\r\n- Extend noinline to `gcc >= 12` to fix `-Werror=maybe-uninitialized` false positives in gcc 15 (#312)\r\n- Fix UB in array related methods (#314)\r\n- Reset optional members when deserializing a `PLAIN_CDR` stream (#316)\r\n- Improve checks for sequence lengths (#329)\r\n- Remove setting of `SERIALIZED_MEMBER_SIZE` when serializing vector of booleans as array (#334)\r\n\r\n## CI improvements\r\n\r\n- Make `skip-ci` label report required statuses as pass (#325)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**PRs (merge order):** #308, #310, #312, #314, #316, #325, #329, #334, #338\r\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eProsima/Fast-CDR/releases/362296486","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eProsima/Fast-CDR/releases/362296486/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/eProsima/Fast-CDR/releases/362296486/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/eProsima/Fast-CDR/releases/tag/v2.4.0","id":362296486,"author":{"login":"zesk1999","id":128973134,"node_id":"U_kgDOB6_5Tg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128973134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999","html_url":"https://github.com/zesk1999","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zesk1999/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOAPKPic4VmDSm","tag_name":"v2.4.0","target_commitish":"d5906d720193175e898df569c8531b095648e668"